# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use PEC to mitigate gates noise and combine it with TREX to also mitigate measurement noise when estimating observables' expectation values.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng gabay na ito kung paano gamitin ang PEC para bawasan ang gate noise at pagsamahin ito sa TREX para bawasan din ang measurement noise kapag tinatantiya ang mga expectation value ng mga observable.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The workflow follows:\n"
"1. Specify a circuit and observable.\n"
"2. Compute exact expectation values by using Qiskit's statevector simulator.\n"
"3. Compute noisy, unmitigated expectation values.\n"
"4. Learn the entangling layers' noise by using qiskit-noise-learning.\n"
"5. Prepare a PEC + TREX program and add a TREX calibration circuit to it.\n"
"6. Compare the mitigated expectation values.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ganito ang workflow:\n"
"1. Tukuyin ang isang circuit at observable.\n"
"2. Kalkulahin ang mga eksaktong expectation value gamit ang statevector simulator ng Qiskit.\n"
"3. Kalkulahin ang mga noisy, unmitigated na expectation value.\n"
"4. Alamin ang noise ng mga entangling layer gamit ang qiskit-noise-learning.\n"
"5. Maghanda ng PEC + TREX program at magdagdag dito ng TREX calibration circuit.\n"
"6. Ihambing ang mga mitigated na expectation value.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a circuit and observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Tukuyin ang isang circuit at observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a mirror circuit of a Trotterized time evolution of a linear transverse-field Ising model on eight qubits. Mirror the circuit to cancel the circuit unitary and form an identity circuit. This lets you easily compute each observable's ideal expectation value. In addition, mirroring doubles the circuit depth, which in turn doubles the noise's effect.\n"
msgstr "Maghanda ng mirror circuit ng Trotterized na time evolution ng isang linear na transverse-field Ising model sa walong qubit. I-mirror ang circuit para kanselahin ang unitary ng circuit at bumuo ng identity circuit. Pinapadali nito ang pagkalkula ng ideal na expectation value ng bawat observable. Bukod dito, dinodoble ng mirroring ang circuit depth, na dinodoble rin ang epekto ng noise.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the angle $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{2}$ to keep all the gates in the circuit from the Clifford group, allowing faster simulation by using the `stabilizer` simulator.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang anggulong $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{2}$ para panatilihing mula sa Clifford group ang lahat ng gate sa circuit, na nagpapahintulot ng mas mabilis na simulation gamit ang `stabilizer` simulator.\n"

